{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-c1","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"衝風冒雨去還歸\n役役勞身似燕兒\n啣得泥來呈疊後\n到頭疊壞復成泥","numbering_in_source":"第三籤","title_in_source":"燕子銜泥","fortune_in_source":"下籤（子宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰一（版本一家族）。頁面標題列首句；吉凶下籤、宮位子宮。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-c2","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"臨風冒雨去還鄉\n正是其身似燕兒\n啣得坭來欲作壘\n到頭壘壞復須坭","numbering_in_source":"第三籤","title_in_source":"燕子銜泥","fortune_in_source":"下籤（子宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰二（版本二家族）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-n1","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-nongli-com","source_text":"冲风冒雨去还归\n役役劳身似燕儿\n卸得泥来呈叠后\n到头叠坏复成泥","numbering_in_source":"第三签","title_in_source":"董永卖身","fortune_in_source":"下签（子宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本一（簡體字呈現），與 chance 詩曰一為同文（正規化後一致）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-n2","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-nongli-com","source_text":"临风冒雨去还乡\n正是其身似燕儿\n卸得坭来欲作垒\n到头垒坏复须泥","numbering_in_source":"第三签","title_in_source":"董永卖身","fortune_in_source":"下签（子宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本二（簡體字呈現），與 chance 詩曰二為同文（正規化後一致）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-z1","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-zhouyi-cc","source_text":"临风冒雨去还乡\n正是其身似燕儿\n卸得泥来欲作垒\n到头垒坏复须泥","numbering_in_source":"第3签","title_in_source":"","fortune_in_source":"下签（子宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本二家族；zhouyi 以單一版本呈現。與 nongli 版本二同文（含 泥/坭 字形差異，正規化後一致）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-003-l1","slip_id":"guanyin-003","source_id":"src-longcheng-org-tw","source_text":"衝風冒雨去還歸\n役役勞身似燕兒\n銜得泥來成壘後\n到頭壘壞復成泥","numbering_in_source":"第三籤","title_in_source":"","fortune_in_source":"","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本一家族內異文（成壘後/壘壞 vs 呈疊後/疊壞）；解曰末句為「到底無成」（chance/nongli 為「到底勞心」）。東嶽廟（跨廟宇）文本流傳證據。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-004-c1","slip_id":"guanyin-004","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"菱花鏡破復重圓\n女再求夫男再婚\n自此門閭重改換\n更添福祿與兒孫","numbering_in_source":"第四籤","title_in_source":"破鏡重圓","fortune_in_source":"上籤（子宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰一（版本一家族）。閭：音同驢（原頁註）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-004-c2","slip_id":"guanyin-004","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"千年古鏡復重圓\n女再求夫男再婚\n自此門庭重改換\n更添福祿在兒孫","numbering_in_source":"第四籤","title_in_source":"破鏡重圓","fortune_in_source":"上籤（子宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰二（版本二家族）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-004-z1","slip_id":"guanyin-004","source_id":"src-zhouyi-cc","source_text":"千年古镜复重圆\n女再求夫男再婚\n自此门庭重改换\n更添福禄在儿孙","numbering_in_source":"第4签","title_in_source":"","fortune_in_source":"上签（子宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本二家族；與 chance 詩曰二為同文（正規化後一致）。nongli 第4籤頁面抽取失敗，本次缺該來源。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-005-c1","slip_id":"guanyin-005","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"一鋤掘地要求泉\n努力求之得最先\n無意俄然遇知己\n相逢攜手上青天","numbering_in_source":"第五籤","title_in_source":"掘地求泉","fortune_in_source":"中籤（丑宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰一（版本一家族）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-005-c2","slip_id":"guanyin-005","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"一錐草地要求泉\n努力求之得最難\n無意俄然遇知己\n相逢攜手上青天","numbering_in_source":"第五籤","title_in_source":"掘地求泉","fortune_in_source":"中籤（丑宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰二（版本二家族）。"}
