{"attestation_id":"att-gy-005-n2","slip_id":"guanyin-005","source_id":"src-nongli-com","source_text":"一锥草地要求泉\n努力求之得最难\n无意俄然遇知己\n相逢携手上青天","numbering_in_source":"第五签","title_in_source":"刘晨遇仙","fortune_in_source":"中签（丑宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本二（簡體字呈現），與 chance 詩曰二為同文（正規化後一致）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-006-c1","slip_id":"guanyin-006","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"投身巖下飼於菟\n須是還他大丈夫\n捨己也應難再得\n通行天下此人無","numbering_in_source":"第六籤","title_in_source":"投岩銅鳥","fortune_in_source":"中籤（丑宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰一（版本一家族）。原頁字註：於菟=老虎（古方言）；鵰本作銅、大本作女、及早本作拾早。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-006-c2","slip_id":"guanyin-006","source_id":"src-chance-org-tw","source_text":"投身岩下鵰鳥居\n須是還他大丈夫\n及早營謀誰可得\n通行天地此人無","numbering_in_source":"第六籤","title_in_source":"投岩銅鳥","fortune_in_source":"中籤（丑宮）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"詩曰二（版本二家族）。"}
{"attestation_id":"att-gy-006-n1","slip_id":"guanyin-006","source_id":"src-nongli-com","source_text":"投身岩下饲于菟\n须是还他大丈夫\n舍己也应难再得\n通行天下此人无","numbering_in_source":"第六签","title_in_source":"仁贵遇主","fortune_in_source":"中签（丑宫）","transcription_method":"manual","transcription_by":"shasha","transcribed_at":"2026-08-15","text_status":"verbatim_confirmed","notes":"版本一（簡體字呈現），與 chance 詩曰一為同文（正規化後一致）。"}
